   *   p2-e-022 `_receive_file` path param (position 3) — attacker-influenced destination
   *            at the sync call sites;
   *   p2-e-027 `receive_file_to_path` path param (position 2) — same shape;
   *   p2-e-045 `RPCDispatcher.dispatch` request param (position 1) — ToDo/unused
